
@startuml
' PetPals - Section 4.4.2
' Booking Lifecycle State Diagram
' Based on database.md and the PetPals requirements and use cases

title PetPals - Booking Lifecycle State Diagram

skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

' Booking states
state "Requested" as Requested
state "Accepted" as Accepted
state "Declined" as Declined
state "In Progress" as InProgress
state "Completed" as Completed

' Initial state
[*] --> Requested : Valid booking request saved

' Helper decision
Requested --> Declined : Helper declines\n[authorized helper]

Requested --> Accepted : Helper accepts\n[authorized helper and slot reserved atomically]

' Service start confirmation
Accepted --> InProgress : Start confirmed\n[both participants, same unexpired attempt]

' Service completion confirmation
InProgress --> Completed : Completion confirmed\n[both participants, same unexpired attempt]

' Final states
Declined --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

' Booking validation rules
note left of Requested
  Only approved, unsuspended users may book.

  The selected pet must belong to the owner.

  The listing and requested time must be valid.

  Invalid requests do not create a booking.
end note

' Accepted booking rules
note right of Accepted
  Stored database value: accepted
  User-facing label may be "Approved".

  Google Calendar synchronization occurs
  after acceptance. A failed synchronization
  does not undo the accepted booking.

  The booked helper initiates Start confirmation
  using either QR code or in-app buttons.

  Both participants must confirm the same
  unexpired attempt.

  A one-sided or expired confirmation
  does not advance the booking.
end note

' Service completion rules
note right of InProgress
  The booked helper initiates Completion
  using either QR code or in-app buttons.

  Both participants must confirm the same
  unexpired completion attempt.

  A one-sided or expired confirmation
  leaves the booking In Progress.
end note

' Completed booking rules
note bottom of Completed
  Reviews are allowed only after completion.

  Both participants may leave a review.

  Disputes are tracked independently
  of the booking status.
end note

' Declined booking rules
note bottom of Declined
  A declined booking cannot progress
  to service confirmation.
end note

' Other system states
legend bottom
  Separate status fields (not booking states):

  booking_confirmations.status:
  pending, confirmed, expired

  calendar_events.sync_status:
  pending, synced, failed

  disputes.status:
  open, resolved

  Cancellation and no-show states
  are not defined in the current draft.
endlegend

@enduml
